  "description": "A server-side adapter for Inertia.js on ASP.NET Core. Build single-page applications with classic server-side routing and controllers, rendering with React, Vue or Svelte on the client. Supports the Inertia v3 protocol: deferred, merged, shared, once and infinite-scroll props that combine freely, rescued deferred props, nested props with dot-notation partial reloads, page-level flash data, big integers as BigInt, history encryption, and precognition.",
